  <item>
    <title>Vol.38 让公开表达成为你的核心能力 内容篇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c0dd333af97665afa220ea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c0dd333af97665afa220ea</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Feb 2024 13:05:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>没有人天生就能字字珠玑，和滑雪、跳舞等任何技能一样，"表达"同样是一门可以通过学习和刻意练习锻炼出来的能力。我们只需要掌握三个要素：新鲜的主题、真实的故事、动人的细节，最后再反复地练习，就能输出一篇好的表达内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>传播有价值的观点并打造你的影响力是一件美好的事，本期是这个系列的第二集：内容篇。Let's start!</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【SHOWNOTES】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场白</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Part One 确定主题</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> 明确你要传播的观点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> 号召观众去付诸行动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="762">12:42</a> 专注于传播一个观点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 与观众建立情感联系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a> 讨论你熟悉并热爱的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1431">23:51</a> 找到自己的角色定位</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Part Two 构思讲稿</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1579">26:19</a> 讲故事还是讲道理？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1743">29:03</a> 如何设计主干逻辑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> 怎么去合适地穿插故事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">35:55</a> 四种非故事例证介绍</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Part Three 编排故事</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2433">40:33</a> 我们应该讲述哪些故事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2617">43:37</a> 三个切入故事的小提示</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2883">48:03</a> 用“英雄之旅”来讲故事</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Part Four 把握关键</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3132">52:12</a> 把观点精炼成口号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3218">53:38</a> 怎么抓住黄金开场白？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3293">54:53</a> 论点之间如何巧妙过渡？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">55:45</a> 好的结尾是什么样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3439">57:19</a> 结束语</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【REFERENCE】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《TED演讲的秘密》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llQqmpWwyLswkxtCUD--xRkQrb3c.m4a" length="57529123" type="audio/mp4"/>
